cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use StressFold in research, please cite the software and record the version used."
title: "StressFold: generalization stress tests for tabular models"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-29
authors:
  - name: "StressFold contributors"
abstract: >-
  StressFold is a deterministic, local-first protocol for measuring clean
  generalization gaps, perturbation-response curves, training stability, and
  label-permutation nulls for tabular binary classification and regression.
keywords:
  - generalization
  - robustness
  - overfitting
  - permutation test
  - tabular machine learning
license: MIT
